## THE WORK (the order is the order)
1. **Baseline first.** Own worktrees (BASE / FIX / MUT). In `.tools/wt-b613-base` (detached at the Stamp main sha; never committed) with node 24 from `.tools/node24/bin` (record `node --version`, `npm --version`, the vitest version): `npm ci` inside `web/`, then `npx vitest run src/server/mock/customer-name.test.ts src/e2e-runner.test.ts` under `--pool=forks` and `--pool=threads` (rows per file per pool), then the whole web unit suite once (`npm test`): files and tests passed/failed/skipped, rc; `npm run lint` and `npm run typecheck` rc (a red baseline is a STOP: report it, do not fix it; a dependency-audit failure is not part of these commands, note it if you see it). For the Api: `dotnet build` of `api/tests/HpsmPoc.Api.Tests` and of `api/tests/HpsmPoc.Modules.Feedback.Tests`, then the class filters once each: `FullyQualifiedName~HpsmPoc.Api.Tests.Assessment.Hpsmpoc178CustomerNameTests` and, in the Feedback project, `FullyQualifiedName~HpsmPoc.Modules.Feedback.Tests.HostStartRetryTests`: total, passed, failed, skipped, rc; the TRX case names of the two classes (the "before"). The whole Api and Feedback projects only if you run them (say so). **Run vitest with `TMPDIR` set to `.tools/b613/scratch/tmp`** (the file's own rows make `hpsm-b502-*` and `hpsm-b510-*` directories with `mkdtempSync` and remove them in `afterEach`); after every run `ls .tools/b613/scratch/tmp` lists nothing left over, or STATUS says what was moved (to `.tools/b613/_quarantine/`, never deleted).
